{"4249780": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gunslinger survivor", "steam_appid": 4249780, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the last survivor of a Far West devastated by a zombie apocalypse. Cities lie in ruins, and the dusty plains echo only with the groans of the undead. Alone against the invasion, your goal is simple: survive for as long as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is an action-survival experience focused on successive waves of zombies. With each wave, enemies become more numerous, faster, and deadlier. Some mutate, while others adopt new behaviors, forcing you to constantly adapt your strategy, positioning, and resource management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with your western weapon, you must manage your ammunition, upgrade your equipment, and use the environment to stay alive. Between waves, explore the area, unlock upgrades, discover hidden zones, and prepare for the next assault.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay emphasizes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >fast-paced and intense combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a steadily increasing difficulty curve</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >constant pressure on survival and decision-making</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a dark western atmosphere blended with zombie horror</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is a challenge: how long will you last before being overwhelmed? Every wave tests your reflexes, your composure, and your ability to survive in a world where hope has long since vanished.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the last survivor of a Far West devastated by a zombie apocalypse. Cities lie in ruins, and the dusty plains echo only with the groans of the undead. Alone against the invasion, your goal is simple: survive for as long as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is an action-survival experience focused on successive waves of zombies. With each wave, enemies become more numerous, faster, and deadlier. Some mutate, while others adopt new behaviors, forcing you to constantly adapt your strategy, positioning, and resource management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with your western weapon, you must manage your ammunition, upgrade your equipment, and use the environment to stay alive. Between waves, explore the area, unlock upgrades, discover hidden zones, and prepare for the next assault.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay emphasizes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >fast-paced and intense combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a steadily increasing difficulty curve</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >constant pressure on survival and decision-making</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a dark western atmosphere blended with zombie horror</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is a challenge: how long will you last before being overwhelmed? Every wave tests your reflexes, your composure, and your ability to survive in a world where hope has long since vanished.</p>", "short_description": "Play as the last survivor of a devastated western world and face increasingly dangerous waves of zombies in a fast-paced action survival game.", "supported_languages": "French<strong>*</strong>, English<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249780/8cd849ca5ee3062cba7289f0270c8f19c525a61e/header.jpg?t=1767445254", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249780/908a8350f993171feb7589d73797afd3d9485d9a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767445254", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4249780/908a8350f993171feb7589d73797afd3d9485d9a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767445254", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Min